    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>51</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></math></p><p>Now let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Now solving,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced><mi>M</mi></mfenced></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced><mi>N</mi></mfenced></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>M</mi></math></p><p>Now using,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><munder><munder><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mi>I</mi></munder><mi>A</mi><munder><munder><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mi>I</mi></munder><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mi>I</mi></munder><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><munder><munder><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>times</mtext></mrow></munder><mi>N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mi>N</mi></math></p><p>Now, using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>51</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>51</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>E</mi></math></p><p>Now finding,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>51</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>51</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, so all higher power will also be zero,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>E</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>&#9181;</mo></munder><mn>0</mn></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msup><mi>E</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mn>0</mn></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msup><mi>E</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mn>0</mn></munder><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>E</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>51</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>51</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"